{"content":[{"c":["KENATH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Town in the Hauran taken by Nobah (",{"href":"?bref=Num.32.42","r":"Num.32.42","rawR":"Num.32.42","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.32.42","value":"Num.32.42"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 32:42"},") but later lost to Geshur and Aram (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.2.23","r":"1Chr.2.23","rawR":"1Chr.2.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.2.23","value":"1Chr.2.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 2:23"},"). It was a Canaanite city known from Egyptian execration texts of the 19th and 18th centuries ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"}," and from the conquest by Thutmose III and the Amarna letters. In the Hellenistic period it became one of the cities of the Decapolis; Jewish returnees from Babylon had settled there, and the rabbis considered it a border town of the Promised Land. It was also called Kanatha."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Kanatha_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Kanatha_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Kanatha_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Kanatha"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Kenath","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Nm 32:42","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.32.42","rawQueryValue":"Num.32.42","sourceRefExact":"Num.32.42"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 2:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.2.23","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.2.23","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.2.23"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"f73778d5264154d173aae63a70d696f9abbeb6fc41e0dc95a1f5e6eee9fe5416","sourceItemName":"Kenath","sourceItemOrder":40,"sourceMember":"Articles/K.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Kenath","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Kenath","title":"Kenath","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}